text": "Beans!", "timestamp": 1772058649, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "drrachelnyc", "author_id": "199975587", "id": "17962063505903708", "text": "Yet none of my clients experience constipation on GLP-1s. One needs to be mindful of their food and water intake, as well as movement. Yes, these medications do slow down the emptying, but there are easy behavioral/ lifestyle things to do to help with this.", "timestamp": 1772053724, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "make_up_by_luba", "author_id": "4173400094", "id": "17890671129426143", "text": "Blaming glp1 instead unhealthy lifestyle. Fix your gut before you start taking glp1. Usually it’s a dose not medication itself. You should get @drsalaswhalen in your podcast. She can actually explain everything.", "timestamp": 1772051760, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "fistfulloftickets", "author_id": "1563623706", "id": "18016562237823991", "text": "@ohiocooper", "timestamp": 1772043763, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "michele_viljoen_stuurman", "author_id": "1560127098", "id": "17864966550506322", "text": "Drink water", "timestamp": 1772039174, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kimberley.ivory", "author_id": "2909921696", "id": "18012593750828344", "text": "Kiwis and magnesium citrate", "timestamp": 1772029100, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "helenbligh_glp1_health", "author_id": "59165461612", "id": "18127987153547832", "text": "Ooh! Would love to see that research about changing microbiome. Any early evidence I’ve seen is that there could be improvement in microbiome.\n@drkaranrajan.", "timestamp": 1772013051, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "boost_lifestyle_nootropics", "author_id": "61342827284", "id": "17994977141914562", "text": "Berberine often called, \"nature's Ozempic\" because it can indirectly increase the body's natural production of GLP-1. Unlike prescription drugs, berberine does not bind directly to GLP-1 receptors. It can provide modest weight loss and Berberine is gut friendly", "timestamp": 1772005749, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "alocke78", "author_id": "3494970413", "id": "17873019987433376", "text": "Protein, fiber, resistance, water and probiotic rich foods like kimchi", "timestamp": 1771978087, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "astro_kitty01", "author_id": "1727283292", "id": "17857822584663704", "text": "Nahhh I only want veggies now 😆", "timestamp": 1771977063, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "shabdarider", "author_id": "1509498385", "id": "18071900963180810", "text": "Don't eat bread or other binding foods. Protein and fiber first.", "timestamp": 1771976672, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "natalinazhang", "author_id": "13001439297", "id": "18362916361165318", "text": "I’m wondering if I have gastroparesis. I was put on GLPs and day three after taking it I ended up in the hospital with severe vomiting. I eat plenty of fiber so it’s not that. My quality of life wasn’t worth taking it, it was so painful.", "timestamp": 1771974280, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "shabdarider", "author_id": "1509498385", "id": "18121809217586728", "text": "Don't eat bread or other binding foods. Protein and fiber first.", "timestamp": 1771973237, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reels/DVHp-2FDHAJ/", "webpage_url_basename": "DVHp-2FDHAJ", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/640550327_18347874328231903_5388999178307807553_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ig_cache_key=MzgzOTIyMTg0NTkzNzkwOTc2OTE4MzQ3ODc0MzIyMjMxOTAz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ddZjbBXVqAIQ7kNvwFskzFp&_nc_oc=AdqJ9XL5edswLkEdxMI4Lgx4g3PBPeYLKNcbgSLyNrhupJN_32AEVt29oCXH9V1VFgA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=oiW5-BtdjYP7Med2CtUYxg&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQJP4bhNlH5GCIshbEMZ3Yk6GZrAcv-0soh06xhbRbSCmA&oe=6AA7548E", "display_id": "DVHp-2FDHAJ", "fulltitle": "Video by